                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Thank you for releasing that T-shirt in December 2025, Mr. Vitão Gemaplys. I wear it a lot, and I love when people ask, “What’s that T-shirt about?” and I get to explain that it’s about a chicken that jumps and is also a U.S. agent and a one-man army personally sent by the POTUS, who is an anime girl, to deal with the Nazis coming back. So you’re fighting Nazis as a chicken that jumps and shit, and I can’t even explain the rest because now I’m worried about spoiling the chicken game for someone who just asked about my shirt.",
